nce. Or someone is too polite to be honest. A given face is neither\na man's nor a woman's. Or it is neither a poor person's nor a rich person's.\nIs it someone who lost his fortune? At every moment, the machine rejects\nfaces that do not conform, or seem suspicious. But only"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-large"}}, "key": "embeddings_dd90e2bb3238e759a27935900402cc5261e2876fc1758e56222a6f060574c234_v2"}